{"obsah":"<p>Organising a women's camp and an exhibition in Ledenice on the same day was a bit of a challenge for us, mainly because of a lot of illness and the absence of guys from the club. In the end we managed to put together a team for both events. This time the camp was led by Mára Tryner, Katarína Tóthová and Matouš Balík, assisted in the morning by Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček.</p>\n\n<p>Around noon, though, Vlasta and Lukáš Valný headed for Ledenice, where the local association's traditional event with a potato pancake cooking contest was taking place. The exhibition in two shows on the square in beautiful weather was great, thanks also to the turnout and the cheering.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>On the other side of the country, women and girls had the chance to take their skills to the next level and, under the guidance of Mára and Katarína, try out what they can do.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>And as if that weren't enough, a recording from Říčanské Šlapačky 2021 was on TV – thanks to the Lvíčata team :) From 18:00: https://decko.ceskatelevize.cz/lvicata </p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F20210925_111720.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F20210925_111720.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"194172\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=194172\" class=\"wp-image-194172\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F20210925_154209.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F20210925_154209.we